===Format===
<!--<span class="mobile-hide">[[File:Swiss System Graphic.png|thumbnail|335px|A graphical explanation of the Swiss System format]]</span>-->
* '''Stage 1:'''
** 16 Team Swiss System Format
*** Elimination and Advancement matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
*** All other matches are {{Abbr/Bo1}}
** Top 8 Teams proceed to ''Stage 2''
** Bottom 8 Teams are eliminated

* '''Stage 2:'''
** 16 Team Swiss System Format
*** Elimination and Advancement matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
*** All other matches are {{Abbr/Bo1}}
** Top 8 Teams proceed to ''Stage 3''
** Bottom 8 Teams are eliminated

* '''Stage 3:'''
** 16 Team Swiss System Format
*** Elimination and Advancement matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
*** All other matches are {{Abbr/Bo1}}
** Top 8 Teams proceed to the ''Playoffs''
** Bottom 8 Teams are eliminated

* '''Playoffs:''' ''December 10<sup>th</sup> - 13<sup>th</sup>, 2026''
** Single-Elimination bracket
** All matches ''(excl. Grand Final)'' are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** The Grand Final is {{Abbr/Bo5}}

